<title>SYRIA: Syria tenders to buy 26,000 T white/raw sugar.</title>
<headline>Syria tenders to buy 26,000 T white/raw sugar.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Foreign Trade Organisation For Chemicals And Foodstuffs (GEZA) has issued a tender to buy 13,000 tonnes of white sugar and 13,000 tonnes of raws, a GEZA spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>February 26 was set as the final date for receiving price offers and the two amounts should be shipped in April.</p>
<p>Results of the tender would be made known on February 27, the official said.</p>
